  "description": "We designed the Fit AM16 for groms (and parents) looking for a lightweight, super-strong frame/fork combo engineered to increase what small humans are capable of on a BMX bike. This American-made, full-chromoly frame is the lightest 16” bike on the market and its lower standover and performance-specific geometry mean your kiddo can kill it on all terrain. The AM16 is guaranteed to increase your child’s confidence as they gain skills that just aren’t as easy to come by on heavier setups. More confidence = more fun and that’s really the name of the game!\n\nThe Fit AM16 fork was designed to be run in tandem with the AM16 Frame – but in the event you are looking to upgrade a different setup, these American-made, full-chromoly forks are as dialed as they come. If a light, strong, short-offset fork with tapered legs and ample peg/tire clearance is what you and your little ripper are after, you’ve found it!",
